      "kind": "note",
      "text": "空行。"
    },
    {
      "at": 17,
      "quote": "// register all surface controls for all callbackIds for this listener that is merging",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "注释：为合并进来的 listener 重新登记所有 SurfaceControl 到 callbackIds 的映射。"
    },
    {
      "at": 18,
      "quote": "for (const auto& surfaceControl : currentProcessCallbackInfo.surfaceControls) {",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "遍历当前进程回调信息里的 SurfaceControl。"
